{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "gi",
  "id": "let-s-go-dodoco",
  "name": "Let's Go, Dodoco!",
  "sourceUrl": "https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Let%27s_Go,_Dodoco!",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-08-12T08:09:31.284Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"All Dodocos must someday ride the wind and the waves and go on an adventure.\" A gentle and beautiful mother once said that."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And just as she had predicted, our Dodoco was so happy when its best friend, Klee, said that she was going to the nation of lightning for an adventure!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Of course, Dodoco loves eating delicious food with Klee at Good Hunter, and loves listening to the bards sing."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But Dodoco loves counting the stars in the sky and twisting flowers into garlands together with Klee more."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "After all, all Dodocos long to ride the wind and waves on an adventure."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-8655f917583e9417"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To get to Inazuma, one needs to pass through the wild winds and pass over the great waves."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But Dodoco did not fear the howling wind, for that was the blessing of the Anemo Archon."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Dodoco did not worry about the rolling waves either, for it was very brave."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Of course, Dodoco didn't want Klee to have to brave such dangers."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But as bestest friends, they were bound to protect each other."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And Dodoco didn't want to be apart from Klee anyway."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Without Klee, adventures would be like Sweet Flowers that cannot bloom, lonely and sad things."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Even if Dodoco were to cover every inch of Teyvat by land or sea, it would be meaningless."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "So there was no point hesitating. Dodoco and its best friend Klee were off on an adventure!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "If they rode on a boat, they wouldn't be able to fly freely in the sky, or swim happily in the sea..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But they'd have Klee's smile and Albedo's stories."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And that was a good trade!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3565d9e2c6a1aae7"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Let's Go Dodoco! Illustration 1.png"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-cb02b006d1ec3ab5"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In Inazuma, the nation of lightning, the flowers and grasses are all purple, and the fish and the birds are also purple. Everything is purple!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Albedo would probably run out of purple paint trying to paint it all."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Unfortunately, he couldn't be around to draw with Klee and Dodoco."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Albedo was an adult, after all. And sometimes adults have to do adult-things."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Fortunately, Dodoco still had Klee!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Klee would often find happy things to do. As long as Dodoco was with Klee, Dodoco would never be bored."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-9af19b9512595a54"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Klee also had lots of friends in Inazuma, like they Honorary Knight, Paimon, and Yoimiya."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And so they all joined Dodoco for the most fun adventure ever in Inazuma!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Hooray for adventure!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-913f20166ef47be7"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "they Honorary Knight took Dodoco up the tall, tall Mt. Yougou."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "When they got to the Sacred Sakura, they were so tired from all that climbing that they fell asleep."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And when they woke up, everyone had grown wings like a tengu!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Klee's wings were red, Yoimiya's were gold, and they Honorary Knight's were blue."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "As for Paimon... Paimon can fly without wings, so Paimon didn't grow any."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Everyone opened their wings up, causing a huge gust of wind to roll forth."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Shooom~ And the shrine maiden's hair was all messed up."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Oh no, she looked angry! Better run, quick!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-49160ea672090585"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Ah, adventure truly was fun... But with a *growl*, Klee's stomach started calling out."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Oh no! How could they have forgotten? Eating is an important part of adventuring too!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Om nom nom nom~ And so everyone ate the onigiri they brought along, and they all had a great time."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Dodoco and Paimon finished their share very quickly, and as the very, very full Dodoco looked at Klee's smile, it couldn't help but think—"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Meeting Klee and the others is the most hap-happiest thing that ever happened to Dodoco!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-cdf50eb12b155fb6"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Let's Go Dodoco! Illustration 2.png|Aether Version"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Let's Go Dodoco! Illustration 4.png|Lumine Version"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-a538bc797817620e"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Oh, yes. If you are reading this, you too are surely part of this big adventure."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Adventuring together, laughing together, enjoying good food together... If you experienced this together with everyone, then you must be their good friend."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In which case, you're invited to Yoimiya's fireworks show as well."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b0d6e8ae18924c07"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Let's Go Dodoco! Illustration 3.png|Aether Version"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Let's Go Dodoco! Illustration 5.png|Lumine Version"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3b54422d26ddf7c6"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "While everyone was happily watching the fireworks, Yoimiya said:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"As long as our imaginations don't run dry, our minds will be freer than all others.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And Klee blurted out: \"We'll always be best friends!\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "See, Dodoco was so happy to be together with its good friends."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And now, you are Dodoco's good friends too. So you, too, should go on a grand adventure with your friends."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-187e26f106a89c45"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
